    "finalPromptText": "I'm updating my graduate cell biology syllabus and want to evaluate Molecular Biology of the Cell (7th ed., 2022, Alberts et al., W.W. Norton).\n\n1. Find the full co-author list and any major structural changes from the 6th edition.\n2. Summarize the topics and chapter organization.\n3. Find published reviews and educator commentary on the 7th edition.\n4. Compare it to Lodish's Molecular Cell Biology and Lewin's Genes per published reviews.",
